ralph/prd.json:6974:      "notes": "Renderer-side contract for worker services pinned by internal/controlplane/dokploy/renderer_worker_test.go: Role=RoleWorker fixed across ServiceApplication+ServiceCompose via workerApplicationInput()/workerComposeInput() helpers. Nine pins: Worker{Application,Compose}Success, DropsWebAndCronFields (leak-safe domain+cron drop), SubtypeBoundaryFromWebAndCron, BuilderMatrix (2 types x 4 builders), ValidationFailures, TierResourceDefaults (no 2-replica bump), RedactsAllVariableValues, Deterministic. Single-role collapse mirrors BE-0303 single-builder collapse: zero production code change. Worker-side dokploy_refs atomic write, quota conversion, and fake Dokploy create/update/deploy/poll/failure/retry/replay defer to a later worker story per the BE-0301 deferral pattern."
