anded in an early migration). Forward-applicable to ANY future repository CRUD-and-invariants story whose table carries a three-trigger UPDATE surface (set_updated_at + bump_version + rewrite-rejecting) AND whose Append fills a zero timestamp server-side in the repository rather than via DB DEFAULT — the per-column trigger-predicate matrix and the ±2s wallclock-bracket pattern are the chokepoints that catch the two most common regression shapes (a demoted trigger column or a removed IsZero default-fill branch).
